                    title="Pre-Black Friday Sale"
                ><div class="menu-item-image-container"><picture><source  type="image/webp" data-srcset="https://www.inncollectiongroup.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Black_Friday_Website_Menu_cropped.png.webp"><img width="1148" height="800" src="data:image/png;base64," class="attachment-full size-full lazyload" alt="" data-eio="p" data-src="https://www.inncollectiongroup.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Black_Friday_Website_Menu_cropped.png" decoding="async" data-eio-rwidth="1148" data-eio-rheight="800" /></picture><noscript><img width="1148" height="800" src="https://www.inncollectiongroup.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Black_Friday_Website_Menu_cropped.png" class="attachment-full size-full" alt="" data-eio="l" /></noscript></div></a><div class="menu-item-description">Available to book now until 30th November, so don’t hang around – download the app, find your perfect inn, and lock in our best Black Friday hotel deal before it’s gone!!</div><a
