<section  class="timetable-block">
    <div  class="l__contain">
                    <div class="timetable-block__content">
                                <p data-start="78" data-end="426">Set right on the St Annes-on-Sea seafront, Offshore is the perfect spot to enjoy delicious home-made food and a wide choice of drinks with a view. Whether you’re calling in for a hearty meal, a relaxed drink with friends, or simply to soak up the coastal atmosphere, our welcoming pub and restaurant are at the heart of this vibrant seaside town.</p>
<p data-start="428" data-end="678">On sunny days, grab a seat outside and breathe in the fresh sea air as you take in sweeping views across the beach. From crisp pints to coffee catch-ups or long, lazy lunches, there’s no better place to relax and watch the world go by on the coast.</p>

                                    <a href="https://events-widget.liveres.co.uk/widget.html?siteId=95a69ab9-027a-40c3-8281-610b32b1c08c&stylingURL=n1y8G" target="_blank" class="btn btn--standard">Book A Table</a>
                            </div>
        
        <div class="timetable-block__times ">
                            <div class="timetable-block__times-title">
                    Serving Times
                </div>
                                        <div class="timetable-block__times-container">
                                            <div class="timetable-block__times-item">
                                                            <div class="timetable-block__times-item--label">
                                    Breakfast
                                </div>
                                                                                        <div class="timetable-block__times-item--range">
                                    7:30am - 11:00am
                                </div>
                                                    </div>
                                            <div class="timetable-block__times-item">
                                                            <div class="timetable-block__times-item--label">
                                    Seasonal Menu (weekdays)
                                </div>
                                                                                        <div class="timetable-block__times-item--range">
                                    5:00pm - 9:00pm
                                </div>
                                                    </div>
                                            <div class="timetable-block__times-item">
                                                            <div class="timetable-block__times-item--label">
                                    Seasonal Menu (weekends)
                                </div>
                                                                                        <div class="timetable-block__times-item--range">
                                    12:00pm - 9:00pm
                                </div>
                                                    </div>
                                    </div>
                                                            <div class="timetable-block__address-content">
                        63-67 South Promenade
Lytham St Annes
Lancashire
FY8 1LZ
                    </div>
                                                    <a target="_blank" class="timetable-block__directions-link" href=https://www.google.com/maps/dir//The+Lindum,+South+Promenade,+Lytham+Saint+Annes/@53.7467448,-3.1111071,12z/data=!4m8!4m7!1m0!1m5!1m1!1s0x487b412bfb1f01b5:0x9a6860fa58a8c412!2m2!1d-3.0288383!2d53.7465891?entry=ttu>
                        <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                            <path d="M6 11.5L2 12.5V3.5L6 2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
                            <path d="M10 13.5L6 11.5V2.5L10 4.5V13.5Z" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
                            <path d="M10 4.5L14 3.5V12.5L10 13.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
                        </svg>
                        <span>
                        Directions
                        </span>
                    </a>
                                    </div>
    </div>
</section>    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    

    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
            
	<div  class="m__iconBlock cf grey ">
		<div class="l__contain">
			<div class="l__row">
								<div class="m__iconBlock--wrapper m__iconBlock--wrapper-7 icon-script-class">
																										<div class="m__iconBlock--item">
									<div class="m__iconBlock--image">
