                    <div class="l__col__evenpad m__section__content-wrap left">
                        <h2>Occasions and Venue Hire</h2>
                        <p>Offshore is the perfect place to host your next big occasion by the sea. With plenty of indoor and outdoor space and flexible food and drink options, we’ll help make your event one to remember.</p>
<p>We also offer a relaxed, welcoming setting for business events and community get-togethers. From networking sessions and club meetings to informal catch-ups, Offshore on the Lancashire coast is the ideal spot to bring people together. Just let us know your plans and we’ll do the rest. Contact us below for more details. </p>
 
                                                    <div class="fifty-fifty-cta-wrapper">
                                                                                    <a href="https://www.inncollectiongroup.com/contact-us/" target="_self"  class="btn btn--standard">Speak to our team</a>
