<section data-wpr-lazyrender="1" class="m__sections m__sections--slider">
    <div  class="slider-component">
     
        <div class="slider-component__slide">
                             <div class="slider-component__slide--image">
                                        <picture><source  type="image/webp" data-srcset="https://www.inncollectiongroup.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/ICG_Dogs-36.jpg.webp"><img src=https://www.inncollectiongroup.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/ICG_Dogs-36.jpg alt= width=4973 height=4973 data-eio="p" data-src="https://www.inncollectiongroup.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/ICG_Dogs-36.jpg" decoding="async" class="lazyload" data-eio-rwidth="4973" data-eio-rheight="3315" /></picture><noscript><img src=https://www.inncollectiongroup.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/ICG_Dogs-36.jpg alt= width=4973 height=4973 data-eio="l" /></noscript>
                </div> 
                        <div class="l__contain">
                <div class="slider-component__slide--content-container">
                                                                <div class="slider-component__slide--title">
                            Looking for dog-friendly pubs in Lytham St Annes?
                        </div>
                                                                                    <div class="slider-component__slide--content">
                            You don't need to stay overnight to enjoy a visit to Offshore! Our dog-friendly dining area is open to everyone, whether you're visiting us for a refreshment after a walk or settling in for a leisurely meal. Dogs can join you in our designated dog-friendly pub and restaurant areas, with water bowls and treats ready and waiting. Feeling peckish? Sir Woofchester’s dog food range means they can tuck into something tasty whilst the humans get stuck into classic pub favourites, all-day dining, Sunday lunch and local cask ales.<br />
<br />
With the Fylde Coast at your fingertips and local walking routes on the doorstep, you can take your pooch out for a good stretch before settling in for some food and drinks.<br />
<br />
So whether you’re looking for dog friendly pubs in Lytham St Annes, somewhere to refuel after a walk or simply a spot where the whole pack can relax, pull up a chair and stay awhile. Good food. Good drinks. Wagging tails. What’s not to like?
                        </div>
                                                                                    <a href="/dog-friendly/" class="btn btn--standard">
                            Discover dog-friendly inns
                        </a>
                                    </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        </div>
</section>    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
