                                                                                                                    </div>
                                                                    <div class="bk-item">
                                        <div class="bk" data-bkimage="https://www.inncollectiongroup.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/070525_InnCollection2896.webp" data-webpalt="https://www.inncollectiongroup.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/070525_InnCollection2896.jpg"><span class="sr-only">070525_InnCollection2896</span></div>
                                                                                                                    </div>
                                                            </div>
                                                                    </div>
                </div>

                                    <div class="right l__col l__col__span5 m__section__content" data-1024="12" data-offby1024="0" >
                                    
                    <div class="l__col__evenpad m__section__content-wrap left">
                        <h2>Our delicious pub food </h2>
                        <p>At Offshore, we believe great food starts with fresh ingredients and plenty of flavour. From Great British pub classics to dishes with a modern twist, our menus are filled with seasonal favourites, all handmade and freshly cooked to order. Whether you’re after a comforting classic, a lighter bite, or something a little different, there’s always something to tempt you.</p>
<p>Set against the backdrop of the Lancashire coast, dining at Offshore is about more than just good food – it’s about the experience. Using local produce wherever possible, we serve hearty meals, tasty light options, and indulgent desserts, all best enjoyed with a drink in hand and those unbeatable seaside views.</p>
 
                                                    <div class="fifty-fifty-cta-wrapper">
                                                                                                                                    </div>
                                            </div>
                </div>
            </div>
                    <div  class="l__row l__row__negative5 m__section left ">
                                    <div class="left l__col l__col__span6 m__section__image " data-1024="12" data-offby1024="0" data-anim="fadeslideright" data-anim__scroll="true" data-anim__animate="true">
                
                    <div class="l__col__evenpad">
                                                    <div class="m__section__image-wrap ">
                                                                    <div class="bk-item">
                                        <div class="bk" data-bkimage="https://www.inncollectiongroup.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Copy-of-Postcards-from.-Grasmere-images-5.webp" data-webpalt="https://www.inncollectiongroup.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Copy-of-Postcards-from.-Grasmere-images-5.jpg"><span class="sr-only">offshore</span></div>
                                                                                                                    </div>
                                                                    <div class="bk-item">
                                        <div class="bk" data-bkimage="https://www.inncollectiongroup.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/L1550823.webp" data-webpalt="https://www.inncollectiongroup.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/L1550823.jpg"><span class="sr-only">L1550823</span></div>
                                                                                                                    </div>
                                                                    <div class="bk-item">
                                        <div class="bk" data-bkimage="https://www.inncollectiongroup.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Copy-of-Postcards-from.-Grasmere-images-4.webp" data-webpalt="https://www.inncollectiongroup.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Copy-of-Postcards-from.-Grasmere-images-4.jpg"><span class="sr-only">offshore</span></div>
                                                                                                                    </div>
                                                            </div>
                                                                    </div>
                </div>

                                    <div class="left l__col l__col__span5 l__col__offby1 m__section__content" data-1024="12" data-offby1024="0" >
                                    
                    <div class="l__col__evenpad m__section__content-wrap left">
                        <h2>A brewed recipe for success</h2>
                        <p>Take in the fresh sea air with a gin in hand out in the beer garden, or shake things up with one of our signature cocktails. Alongside local real ales and rotating guest hand pulls, you’ll also find perfectly chilled continental lagers, refreshing ciders, and a wide choice of bottled craft beers full of character – plenty to keep you coming back to try something new.</p>
<p>Our well-stocked bar also offers wines from around the world, available by the glass or bottle, with something to suit every taste and dish. And if you’re in the mood for something softer, settle in with a pot of tea, a smooth barista coffee, or one of our Ringtons speciality loose-leaf teas – perfect for unwinding by the coast.</p>
 
                                                    <div class="fifty-fifty-cta-wrapper">
                                                                                                                                    </div>
                                            </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            </div>
</div>            

    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    

    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
